---
/** Architecture of Junk to Luxury as designed: the client asks, the server decides. */
---

<figure class="flow">
  <ol class="chain" aria-label="Request flow, left to right">
    <li class="node"><b>Client</b><span>UI and controllers. Requests an action and renders state</span></li>
    <li class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"><em>one network module</em>→</li>
    <li class="node ea"><b>Server services</b><span>Validate and decide: ownership, distance, cooldown, cost</span></li>
    <li class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</li>
    <li class="node"><b>Persistence</b><span>Versioned profile with session lock and sanitising on load</span></li>
  </ol>
  <div class="rail">
    <div class="shared">
      <b>Shared: frozen config tables and pure rules</b>
      <span>Balance numbers live in data, never in logic; the same rules are used by the server and by the tests</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="sr-only">
    The client sends requests through a single network module to server services, which validate and decide, and persist a versioned profile. Shared frozen configuration and pure rules feed the server and the tests.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .flow {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .chain {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .node {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    align-content: start;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 4%, transparent);
  }
  .node.ea {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, transparent);
  }
  b {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  span {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .arrow {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    gap: 2px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 18px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .arrow em {
    font: 500 10px/1 var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .shared {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--line-strong);
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .chain {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .arrow {
      rotate: 90deg;
      padding: 2px 0;
    }
    .arrow em {
      rotate: -90deg;
    }
  }
</style>
